#: src/menus/colors/info/export-histogram.xml:10(title)
#: src/menus/colors/info/export-histogram.xml:14(secondary)
#: src/menus/colors/info/export-histogram.xml:17(primary)
msgid "Export Histogram"
msgstr "Exportera histogram"

#: src/menus/colors/info/export-histogram.xml:22(para)
msgid ""
"Exports the image histogram to a text file, so it can be used by other "
"programs and loaded into spreadsheets. The histogram is produced for the "
"selected image area. Fully transparent pixels are not counted."
msgstr ""
"Exporterar bildens histogram till en textfil som kan användas av andra "
"program och läsas in i kalkylblad. Histogrammet beräknas för det markerade "
"bildområdet. Helt genomskinliga bildpunkter räknas inte."

#: src/menus/colors/info/export-histogram.xml:27(para)
msgid ""
"The resulting file is a CSV file (Comma Separated Values), which can be "
"imported directly in most spreadsheet programs. The first row of the CSV "
"file is a title row. One data row is generated for each \"Bucket\". Each "
"pixel value can be in the range of 0 to 255, and will be included in one of "
"the buckets depending on the bucket's range."
msgstr ""
"Resultatet är en CSV-fil (kommaavgränsade värden) som kan importeras direkt "
"i de flesta kalkylbladsprogram. Den första raden innehåller kolumnrubriker. "
"Därefter skapas en datarad för varje värdeintervall. Varje bildpunktsvärde "
"ligger mellan 0 och 255 och placeras i ett intervall utifrån intervallets "
"gränser."

#: src/menus/colors/info/export-histogram.xml:33(para)
msgid ""
"The first column is titled \"Range Start\" and contains the starting value "
"of the bucket. The following columns contain the values for different "
"channels. Which channels will be included depends on the image type. The "
"meaning of the values in each of the channel columns, depends on the "
"<guilabel>Output Format</guilabel> option."
msgstr ""
"Den första kolumnen heter ”Intervallstart” och innehåller startvärdet för "
"intervallet. De följande kolumnerna innehåller värden för olika kanaler. "
"Vilka kanaler som tas med beror på bildtypen. Vad värdena i kanalkolumnerna "
"betyder beror på alternativet <guilabel>Utmatningsformat</guilabel>."

#: src/menus/colors/info/export-histogram.xml:40(title)
msgid "Example of file exported by <quote>Export Histogram</quote>"
msgstr "Exempel på fil som exporteras av <quote>Exportera histogram</quote>"

#: src/menus/colors/info/export-histogram.xml:41(screen)
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"Range start,   Value,   Red,   Green,   Blue\n"
"          0,     0.0,   0.0,   486.0,    0.0\n"
"          1,     0.0,   0.0,   300.0,    0.0\n"
"          2,     0.0,   0.0,   336.0,    0.0\n"
"          3,     0.0,   0.0,   399.0,    0.0\n"
"          4,     0.0,   0.0,   510.0,    0.0\n"
"          ....\n"
"      "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Intervallstart, Värde, Röd, Grön, Blå\n"
"          0,     0.0,   0.0,   486.0,    0.0\n"
"          1,     0.0,   0.0,   300.0,    0.0\n"
"          2,     0.0,   0.0,   336.0,    0.0\n"
"          3,     0.0,   0.0,   399.0,    0.0\n"
"          4,     0.0,   0.0,   510.0,    0.0\n"
"          ....\n"
"      "

#: src/menus/colors/info/export-histogram.xml:51(para)
msgid ""
"The example file above was generated for an RGB image, using the "
"<guilabel>Pixel count</guilabel> output format, and a <guilabel>Bucket "
"Size</guilabel> of 1. The row starting with the number 3 describes the "
"fourth bucket and will include all pixels from value 3 up to (but not "
"including) value 4. The number 399.0 in that row can then be interpreted as "
"\"There are 399 pixels that have a Green value of 3\"."
msgstr ""
"Exempelfilen ovan skapades för en RGB-bild med utmatningsformatet "
"<guilabel>Antal bildpunkter</guilabel> och en "
"<guilabel>Intervallstorlek</guilabel> på 1. Raden som börjar med talet 3 "
"beskriver det fjärde intervallet och omfattar alla bildpunkter från värdet 3"
" till, men inte inklusive, värdet 4. Värdet 399,0 på den raden betyder att "
"”399 bildpunkter har det gröna kanalvärdet 3”."

#: src/menus/colors/info/export-histogram.xml:63(para)
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the main menu through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Colors</guimenu><guisubmenu>Info</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Export"
" Histogram…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar kommandot i huvudmenyn under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Färger</guimenu><guisubmenu>Info</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Exportera"
" histogram…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#: src/menus/colors/info/export-histogram.xml:76(title)
msgid "<quote>Export Histogram</quote> options"
msgstr "Alternativ för <quote>Exportera histogram</quote>"

#: src/menus/colors/info/export-histogram.xml:86(term)
msgid "Histogram File"
msgstr "Histogramfil"

#: src/menus/colors/info/export-histogram.xml:88(para)
msgid "The file into which the histogram will be exported."
msgstr "Filen som histogrammet exporteras till."

#: src/menus/colors/info/export-histogram.xml:94(term)
msgid "Bucket Size"
msgstr "Intervallstorlek"

#: src/menus/colors/info/export-histogram.xml:96(para)
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Bucket Size</guilabel> lets you control the number of values "
"considered as similar and counted in the same <quote>bucket</quote>. A "
"higher bucket size will produce less buckets, and thus less rows in the "
"exported file. For example, a Bucket Size of 1 will produced 256 buckets, "
"whereas a bucket size of 16 will produce 16 buckets."
msgstr ""
"Med <guilabel>Intervallstorlek</guilabel> anger du hur många värden som ska "
"räknas som likartade och hamna i samma <quote>intervall</quote>. Större "
"intervallstorlek ger färre intervall och därmed färre rader i den "
"exporterade filen. Storleken 1 ger till exempel 256 intervall, medan "
"storleken 16 ger 16 intervall."

#: src/menus/colors/info/export-histogram.xml:106(term)
msgid "Sample Average"
msgstr "Medelvärde för samplade bildpunkter"

#: src/menus/colors/info/export-histogram.xml:108(para)
msgid ""
"If <guilabel>Sample Average</guilabel> is activated, the histogram will be "
"generated for an image obtained by merging all visible layers. Otherwise, "
"the histogram will only consider the current layer."
msgstr ""
"Om <guilabel>Medelvärde för samplade bildpunkter</guilabel> är aktiverat "
"skapas histogrammet från en bild där alla synliga lager har sammanfogats. "
"Annars beräknas histogrammet bara för det aktuella lagret."

#: src/menus/colors/info/export-histogram.xml:116(term)
msgid "Output format"
msgstr "Utmatningsformat"

#: src/menus/colors/info/export-histogram.xml:118(para)
msgid ""
"If the <guilabel>Pixel count</guilabel> option is chosen, the values in the "
"generated file will reflect the amount of pixels in each bucket. If "
"<guilabel>Normalized</guilabel> is chosen, the values will be the amount of "
"pixels in the bucket divided by the total amount of pixels. The "
"<guilabel>Percent</guilabel> option is similar to "
"<guilabel>Normalized</guilabel>, but the values are formatted as percents."
msgstr ""
"Om du väljer <guilabel>Antal bildpunkter</guilabel> visar värdena i filen "
"antalet bildpunkter i varje intervall. Med <guilabel>Normaliserad</guilabel>"
" divideras antalet bildpunkter i intervallet med det totala antalet "
"bildpunkter. <guilabel>Procent</guilabel> fungerar på samma sätt som "
"<guilabel>Normaliserad</guilabel>, men värdena visas i procent."

